    <string name="settings_hotkeys_title">Terminal hotkeys</string><string name="settings_hotkeys_summary">Grid layout, button size, names, and shortcuts</string><string name="settings_hotkeys_description">Enter frequently used key combinations with one tap. Edit names, order, and size, then save to apply them.</string><string name="hotkey_enabled">Use terminal hotkeys</string><string name="hotkey_enabled_support">Hide the hotkey buttons below the terminal when off. Your layout is kept. Save to apply.</string><string name="hotkey_columns">Maximum columns</string><string name="hotkey_font_size">Key text size (sp)</string><string name="hotkey_span">Key width (grid cells)</string><string name="hotkey_preview">Layout preview</string><string name="hotkey_preview_support">Tap a key to edit it, or long-press and drag it to the insertion line to reorder. Hold near the top or bottom edge to scroll. Save changes to apply them. Up to 48 keys can be added.</string><string name="hotkey_edit_description">Edit key %1$d: %2$s, %3$s</string><string name="hotkey_add">Add hotkey</string><string name="hotkey_edit">Edit hotkey</string><string name="hotkey_name">Button name</string><string name="hotkey_name_support">Choose a name from 1 to 32 characters.</string><string name="hotkey_shortcut">Key or shortcut</string><string name="hotkey_shortcut_hint">For example: CTRL+C, ALT+LEFT, CTRL+SHIFT+TAB</string><string name="hotkey_supported_keys">Supported keys and input</string><string name="hotkey_shortcut_support">Combine CTRL, ALT, SHIFT, letters, numbers, or symbols. Special keys include ESC, TAB, ENTER, BACKSPACE, DELETE, INSERT, HOME, END, PAGEUP, PAGEDOWN, arrows, F1–F12, SPACE, and PLUS.</string><string name="hotkey_move_before">Move before</string><string name="hotkey_move_after">Move after</string><string name="hotkey_remove">Delete hotkey</string><string name="hotkey_reset">Restore defaults</string><string name="hotkey_reset_support">Replace the edited layout and custom hotkeys with defaults? Save in settings to apply.</string><string name="hotkey_discard">Discard unsaved changes?</string><string name="kitty_remote_control">Kitty remote control</string><string name="kitty_remote_control_support">Allow programs in new sessions to create, select, input to, and terminate tabs in the same environment. Enable only for trusted programs.</string>
